Major changes:
* Improved several maps' visuals and layout;
* Separated ways of gaining reputation and loyalty;
* Improved behavior of ships in battle;
* Improved the game interface;
* Fixed several bugs, including MAC bugs.

For a complete list of changes go there:
http://forum.gaijinent.com/index.php?/topic/18512-star-conflict-obt-v0710/

